title: "Cyber-Physics: Deterministic Operational Governance for Distributed Cyber Infrastructures"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Kazem"
    given-names: "Munther"

version: "1.0"

date-released: 2026-05-19

url: "https://www.prospacetech.com/"

abstract: >
  Cyber-Physics introduces a deterministic operational governance
  architecture for distributed cyber infrastructures based on
  PDE-constrained propagation control, CFL stability enforcement,
  thermal pressure estimation, temporal resonance modeling,
  and deterministic containment orchestration.

keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - deterministic systems
  - runtime governance
  - distributed systems
  - CFL stability
  - temporal resonance
  - operational physics
  - real-time containment
  - cyber-physics
